        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 striking @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Harpoon]</em> has a vicious iron tip that pulls it unerringly toward its target. As long as the target is warm-blooded, has the fire trait, or otherwise has an unusual heat signature, attacks with the heat-seeking harpoon don't take the normal penalties and restrictions for being used in water or underwater. They also ignore any concealment granted by smoke, darkness, or other visual barriers.</p>"
